<title>UK: Banco BBA Creditanstalt has $100 mln one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BBA Creditanstalt has $100 mln one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Creditanstalt-Bankverein and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BBA CREDITANSTALT</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    15.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
